{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11109260","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11109260","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1110926001:0":{"text":"……放手。","source_cn":"……放手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1F7393E9FADB1F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110926002:1":{"text":"话不能这么说，小兄弟。项链是咱俩同时抢到的，分不出先来后到。","source_cn":"话不能这么说，小兄弟。项链是咱俩同时抢到的，分不出先来后到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44F5570AEDBE158E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110926003:1":{"text":"我不可能比你慢。","source_cn":"我不可能比你慢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x262DCC5A3F8A7E79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110926004:1":{"text":"嗬，真有脾气。","source_cn":"嗬，真有脾气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB10881ACA8639781","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110926005:1":{"text":"要不是我拦住阿德那小子，他早就跑了。就算你们再有二十只仓鼠，也拦不住他。","source_cn":"要不是我拦住阿德那小子，他早就跑了。就算你们再有二十只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5475698F98FD9831","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110926006:1":{"text":"那么多人只会拖累我。","sou